va.example.cfb5e8151dfaf9b9d105","prompt":"sleep(100) 后能保证恰好 100 毫秒就继续吗？","reveal":"不能。只用它表达等待意图，需要精确调度时另选合适机制。"},{"id":"java.check.a77310acbf0d67131164","lessonId":"java.lesson.a77310acbf0d67131164","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.a77310acbf0d67131164","prompt":"起点 1000、终点 4500，两个 nanoTime 采样的差是多少？","reveal":"3500 纳秒。单个采样不是可用于日历转换的绝对时间。"},{"id":"java.check.5ba0b63d6568dc4c2d9b","lessonId":"java.lesson.5ba0b63d6568dc4c2d9b","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.5ba0b63d6568dc4c2d9b","prompt":"两台机器默认时区不同，读 Calendar.HOUR_OF_DAY 可能有何不同？","reveal":"即使底层时刻相同，当地小时字段也可能不同。"},{"id":"java.check.4038327d3b8e8eaf8d5f","lessonId":"java.lesson.4038327d3b8e8eaf8d5f","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.4038327d3b8e8eaf8d5f","prompt":"set(2026, 10, 7) 的月份是十月还是十一月？","reveal":"十一月。0 对应一月，10 对应十一月。"},{"id":"java.check.66da5635ca306a4b7648","lessonId":"java.lesson.66da5635ca306a4b7648","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.66da5635ca306a4b7648","prompt":"下午三点用 HOUR_OF_DAY 和 HOUR 分别读到多少？","reveal":"分别为 15 和 3。只读 HOUR 还需要 AM_PM 才能还原时刻。"},{"id":"java.check.2f3328785c13f3084f4c","lessonId":"java.lesson.2f3328785c13f3084f4c","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.2f3328785c13f3084f4c","prompt":"在已设 2026-01-31 的 Calendar 上 add(DAY_OF_MONTH,1) 得什么日期？","reveal":"2026-02-01。按日历增加一天会跨过月末。"},{"id":"java.check.c4587086cbe62e0f6ac5","lessonId":"java.lesson.c4587086cbe62e0f6ac5","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.c4587086cbe62e0f6ac5","prompt":"get(Calendar.MONTH) 返回 0，给用户显示第几月？","reveal":"显示一月。内部字段 0 是零起始约定。"},{"id":"java.check.7b4c492c25b82337cae3","lessonId":"java.lesson.7b4c492c25b82337cae3","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"java.example.7b4c492c25b82337cae3","prompt":"1900 和 2000 哪一年为闰年？","reveal":"2000 是闰年，1900 不是。两者都能被 100 整除，但只有 2000 能被 400 整除。"}],"references":[]}
